<http://purl.org/vocab/frbr/core#supplement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://purl.org/vocab/frbr/core#> .
_:n3ae03b620cb34e859c211b82ae43b76ab18 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://purl.org/vocab/frbr/core#Work> .
_:n3ae03b620cb34e859c211b82ae43b76ab17 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:n3ae03b620cb34e859c211b82ae43b76ab18 .
_:n3ae03b620cb34e859c211b82ae43b76ab21 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://purl.org/vocab/frbr/core#Work> .
<http://purl.org/vocab/frbr/core#supplement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\nAn expression work/expression having another one as supplement.\n        "@en .
_:n3ae03b620cb34e859c211b82ae43b76ab19 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://purl.org/vocab/frbr/core#supplement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://purl.org/vocab/frbr/core#relatedEndeavour> .
<http://purl.org/vocab/frbr/core#supplement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> _:n3ae03b620cb34e859c211b82ae43b76ab19 .
<http://purl.org/vocab/frbr/core#supplement> <http://www.linkedmodel.org/schema/vaem#rationale> "\nThis is used in combination with [OWL2 punning](http://www.w3.org/TR/2009/WD-owl2-new-features-20090611/#F12:_Punning) to characterise the type of a relation ('IsSupplementedBy') as an instance of `datacite:QualifiedRelation` via the property `datacite:hasRelationCharacterization`.\n        "@en .
_:n3ae03b620cb34e859c211b82ae43b76ab20 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:n3ae03b620cb34e859c211b82ae43b76ab21 .
_:n3ae03b620cb34e859c211b82ae43b76ab20 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://purl.org/vocab/frbr/core#Expression> .
_:n3ae03b620cb34e859c211b82ae43b76ab19 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#unionOf> _:n3ae03b620cb34e859c211b82ae43b76ab20 .
_:n3ae03b620cb34e859c211b82ae43b76ab18 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
<http://purl.org/vocab/frbr/core#supplement> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://purl.org/vocab/frbr/core#supplement> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/example> "\n        :relation-dataset-article a datacite:QualifiedRelation ;\n                datacite:hasRelationCharacterization frbr:supplement .\n        " .
_:n3ae03b620cb34e859c211b82ae43b76ab16 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#unionOf> _:n3ae03b620cb34e859c211b82ae43b76ab17 .
<http://purl.org/vocab/frbr/core#supplement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has supplement"@en .
_:n3ae03b620cb34e859c211b82ae43b76ab21 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
_:n3ae03b620cb34e859c211b82ae43b76ab17 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://purl.org/vocab/frbr/core#Expression> .
<http://purl.org/vocab/frbr/core#supplement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> _:n3ae03b620cb34e859c211b82ae43b76ab16 .
<http://purl.org/vocab/frbr/core#supplement> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://purl.org/vocab/frbr/core#supplementOf> .
_:n3ae03b620cb34e859c211b82ae43b76ab16 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://purl.org/vocab/frbr/core#supplement> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "stable"@en .
<http://purl.org/vocab/frbr/core#supplement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "\nThe supplement relationship type involves works/expressions that are intended to be used in conjunction with another work/expression. \nSome of these, such as indices, concordances, teachers' guides, glosses, and instruction manuals for electronic resources will be so closely associated with the content of the related work/expression that they are useless without the other work/expression.\n        "@en .
